  // ---- calorie estimates (workout + steps), for the daily energy-balance card ----
  // There's no clean formula for "weight moved" → energy burned, so this uses the
  // standard MET (metabolic equivalent) approach instead: estimate how long the
  // session actually took — active lifting time per set, plus whatever rest was
  // actually logged between sets — and convert that duration through a general
  // resistance-training MET value. Always an estimate, same caveat as every fitness
  // tracker's "calories burned" number (Apple Watch, Fitbit, MyFitnessPal included) —
  // shown as an estimate in the UI, never presented as a precise reading.
  const RESISTANCE_TRAINING_MET = 5; // Compendium of Physical Activities — general free-weight/machine resistance training, moderate effort

